<title>USA: Butler National Corp gets $500,000 order.</title>
<headline>Butler National Corp gets $500,000 order.</headline>
<dateline>OLATHE, Kansas 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Butler National Corp said Friday that it received an order at its Avcon Subsidiary in Newton, Kansas.</p>
<p>The order, valued at approximately $500,000, involves highly specialized proprietary work, said the company in a statement dated Oct 9. The company said that the aircraft will have these modifications completed within the next 90 days.</p>
</text>
